{
  "comment": [
    "Maps supplied artwork to book-package assets. Source art is raster; the",
    "package contract is SVG (PRD 17.9), so tools/import_artifacts.py traces each",
    "entry through tools/vectorize.py into the 18.5 subset.",
    "",
    "mode 'solid' is for anything drawn inside a maze cell, where a finale",
    "collectible prints at about 5.5 mm and an outline would close up on press.",
    "mode 'outline' is for story-page decoration, which prints at 0.6 in and up.",
    "",
    "'cover' entries are not assets at all: a KDP cover is a separate colour PDF,",
    "and the interior pipeline never reads them."
  ],
